# Build output of `npm run build:engine`. Regenerable in one command, so it is not
# committed here - the COMMITTED copy of the engine bundle is the Swift package resource
# at ios/Packages/MQEngineJS/Sources/MQEngineJS/Resources/engine.bundle.js, which SwiftPM
# and Xcode need on disk without running Node. `npm run check:engine` proves that copy is
# not stale; `npm test` runs the same check.
